origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.md:48:        "mode": "runtime",
origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.md:62:- `mode` defaults to `full`. The optional `commands` list applies to `runtime` requirements and narrows the activation to the named exports. Each named command must exist in the provider as `type: script`.
origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.md:104:| `runtime` | — | exported commands, optionally narrowed by `commands` |
origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.md:107:`full` serves delegation: the agent reads the provider contract and runs its commands. `runtime` serves plumbing: the consumer's scripts call the provider executable, and the consumer's own SKILL.md documents the behavior it exposes. `context` serves rules-only providers such as convention or methodology skills.
origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.md:109:When several consumers require one provider, the effective surface is the union of the edges: a `full` edge yields `full`; otherwise the runtime command sets merge, and a `context` edge adds the prompt context.
origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.md:123:For development, `Skillfile.dev.json` substitutes providers locally. The file sits next to `Skillfile.json`, belongs to the managed `.gitignore` block that `csk init` writes, and stays out of version control. A substitution applies to the whole closure and accepts a local path or a git source with any ref kind, branches included:
origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.md:138:The installer materializes each node once, according to its effective mode, over the existing layers: the prompt context copies into `.agents/skills/<name>/` and mirrors into the agent adapters; runtime roots copy into the runtime store; command shims land in `.agents/bin`.
origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.md:142:- The install marker (`.csk-install.json`) of each node extends the existing content-hash record with the resolved commit, the canonical source, the effective mode, and the requirers. The markers make the installed closure auditable offline.
origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.md:184:- Version ranges, the skill semver contract, and a lockfile. Ranges make resolution outcomes depend on the available tags, and the lockfile lands in the same RFC that introduces them.
origin/main:docs/v0.9-design.ru.md:15:- Три режима активации определяют, что зависимость даёт потребителю: `full` даёт промпт-контекст и команды, `runtime` даёт команды, `context` даёт промпт-контекст.
